License scope for this multi-project collection

This collection has multiple license scopes. There is no single MIT grant over every file.

NGA2 and NGA2-derived examples retain the original Olivier Desjardins MIT notice in licenses/MIT-NGA2.txt and NOTICE_NGA2.md.
Original LICA Fortran and its derivatives retain the original Haecheon Choi copyright and "Noncommercial use with copyrighted mark" notice in their source headers. These files are not relicensed under MIT.
Separate SPECFEM3D reference excerpts retain GPL-3.0-or-later terms, original author notices and licenses/GPL-3.0.txt.
Independent new helper/render/controller code and independent new C++ kernels retain the MIT scope stated in NOTICE.md, except where another original notice applies.
Third-party geometry and animation assets are excluded; references/attribution do not change their separate terms.

See docs/LICENSE_MAP.md and original source headers for the file scopes. Preserve those notices when copying any case.
